# BWV 610 "Jesu, meine Freude", J. S. Bach, from the Mutopia LilyPond file
# songs/LilyPond/bach-bwv610.ly (Peters edition, ed. Ernst H. Wolfram).
# The manuals are one track with three voice layers (the chorale, and the
# two inner voices of the right and left hands); the pedal is its own track.
#
# Does not load yet: minor keys are not designed, and key C minor is
# refused (Song Notation, Q12).
